    "title": "Listening",
    "content": "<p>Good morning everyone. Today I'd like to tell you about our city library. The library was established in 1998 and has become one of the most popular places for students and local residents.</p><p>The library opens at 8:00 a.m. and closes at 8:00 p.m. from Monday to Friday. On weekends, it opens at 10:00 a.m. and closes at 5:00 p.m.</p><p>There are more than 50,000 books available, including novels, textbooks, magazines, and reference materials. Visitors can borrow up to five books at a time for a period of two weeks.</p><p>The library also offers free internet access and study rooms for students. Every Wednesday evening, a reading club meets to discuss books and share recommendations.</p><p>Last year, more than 10,000 people visited the library. The management plans to expand the children's section and introduce new digital resources in the future.</p>",
